<title>USA: Public Service New Mexico Q3 shr declines.</title>
<headline>Public Service New Mexico Q3 shr declines.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.47		    $0.68</p>
<p> Net		 19,900		   29,000</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.42		    $1.60</p>
<p> Net		 59,900		   70,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) Full company name is Public Service Co of New Mexico</p>
<p>NOTE: Third quarter 1995 included a $6.8 million or $0.16 per share gain on the sale of the company's water utility. Third quarter 1996 earnings were reduced by a $3 million accrual to fund the company's results-based pay plan. The company said most of the accrual for 1995 results pay awards was not made until the fourth quarter 1995. Non-recurring items added $0.49 per share to the first nine months 1995.</p>
